      "message": "just a heads up, you can use the lineage script git-push-merge-review so that it won\u0027t upload commits separately and also spam my email with all the stuff I merged to qcom sm8150 org XD\n\nFirst, I add a remote to make life easier:\n\ngit remote add gerrit ssh://themard@review.lineageos.org:29418/LineageOS/android_kernel_lenovo_sm8150\n\nSecond, I use the script to push to gerrit:\n\n./../../../lineage/scripts/git-push-merge-review/git-push-merge-review gerrit HEAD lineage-24.0\n\nYou can change HEAD to a commit hash if you have a few commits or merges to do.\n\nThen, do code review on gerrit, and once happy, just push it to the branch as gerrit won\u0027t merge merges\n\ngit push gerrit HEAD:refs/heads/lineage-24.0",
